a wandering child~
a wandering child~
This child is wandering far from the city.
~
This child has left Bazabel for an adventure along the now deserted Silver
Path.  They don't seem scared by the ghost stories and other legends of the
Ghouls and Elves magik that long since cursed this road.  They cheerily
explore, hoping to find adventure.
~
